idea voting board
user: friends deciding on a single course of action for fun activities or lightweight simple options
problem: friction in plan decision, friends are indecisive in choosing options
hypothesis: groups of individuals like to make plans but are unable to choose on a single thing
question: will people decide on courses of action much easier if it’s made more simple through an ideas board
core flow: users present options, options are centralized on board, users choose options from board
acceptance criteria:
if multiple users can submit ideas and they show up on the board
if users can vote for the submitted ideas and the highest voted idea wins
if users can see all ideas in the same place
